Text Notes 800 10100 0 75 ~ 0
SPI MSB first: [0x20 | (address & 0x1F), data]. LATCH, wait >=2 us, then REQ >=20 us High / Low.
Text Notes 800 10400 0 75 ~ 0
CS1 is U3.QF (pin 5), not U3.QE as in POKEY. Boot pull-down R11 and OE circuit Q1 are retained.
Text Notes 800 10700 0 75 ~ 0
Only audio registers 0x15...0x1A are exposed by firmware. No WSYNC/RSYNC access. M3 VIN must use 3V3_ESP.
$EndSCHEMATC
